cassini-viewer (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Record meetings: microphone and desktop audio, and browser meetings
    per source through the companion extension and its native messaging
    hosts, registered per user.
  * Name missing libraries and GStreamer plugins at startup.
  * Build and test the package with the same script locally and in CI.

